OL,3,GNEWSA'Anywhere dog is wonderful, this
OL,4,Ais totally dog'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHumans and their canine companions have
OL,7,Fheaded to the gardens of a stately
OL,8,Fmansion for a festival of all things
OL,9,Fdog.
OL,11,FThe North East Dog Festival has been
OL,12,Ftaking place in the grounds of Kirkley
OL,13,FHall, a Grade-II listed stately home in
OL,14,FNorthumberland dating back to the
OL,15,F1600s.
OL,17,FThe event invited people to bring their
OL,18,Ffurry four-legged friends to try new
OL,19,Factivities, training, sports, and take
OL,20,Fpart in competitions.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
