OL,3,GNEWSA'Anywhere dog is wonderful, this
OL,4,Ais totally dog'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCo-founder and dog trainer Rebecca
OL,7,FEarle, who began the event in 2015 with
OL,8,FDawn Oliver-Doyle, said this year's
OL,9,Ffestival had more visitors than ever
OL,10,Fbefore.
